          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paliji pana cipinda ni litanga lyakwe ciŵandika ni lipenu lya cipata kwele kuŵacapilaga nyama jakupelecela mbopesi jakutinisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwipenu mwaliji matebulo gaŵili, mbali jilijose tebulo jimo. Ŵawulajilaga nyama pa matebulopo syakupeleka mbopesi syakutinisya, mbopesi syakupecesya ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni mbopesi syakupecesya kupalamula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusa kwakwe kwa lipenu lyamkati lila lya ku cipata ca kumpoto kwaliji kwana matebulo gaŵili, soni mbali jinejo jakwete matebulo gaŵili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matebulo mcece galiji mkati, soni gane mcece galiji kusa kwa cipataco, pampepe galiji matebulo msano ni gatatu gele gaŵawulajilaga nyama syakupeleka mbopesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matebulo mcece gakupelecela mbopesi syakutinisya galiji ga maganga gakusepa. Tebulo jilijose mcilewu ni mcijipi mwakwe jaliji masentimita 75 soni msingu wakwe waliji masentimita 50. Pa tebulopo ŵaŵikaga yida yakamulicisya masengo pakutaga mbopesi syakutinisya ni mbopesi sine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo nyama ja mbopesi ŵajiŵikaga pa matebulogo. Yosope ulewu wakwe mpela ligasa ŵayitaŵililaga kusyungulila tebulo jilijose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
